      "heading": "Introducere",
      "level": 1,
      "content_markdown": "We have a pleasure to inform you about new **MILITARY ITEMS**  in our offer :\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/tec2-ml-mail-v2.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t01400-4ml_2s.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t01400-4ml_1s.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t01450-1ml_3s.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t01450-1ml_1s.jpg)\n\n** I-st stage V1 ICE – EN250A – Military Line**\n\n**– I-st stage R2 TEC with 5-th LP port – EN250A – Military Line**\n\n**– II-nd stage TEC2 black, reversible – EN250A – Military Line**\n\n**– 90 degree fixed swivel adaptor for II-nd stage, black – Military Line**\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/karab-ml-mai-del.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t01055ml-s.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t01049-2ml_2s.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t01049-2mls.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/karab-ml-mai-dl.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t01103ml-s.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t06003ml-s.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t06020ml_1s.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t06020ml_2s.jpg)\n\n![](https://transilvaniacavediving.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/t06010ml_2s.jpg)\n\n**– B-ring on tri glider 45 degrees, black – Military Line**\n\n**– B-ring on tri glide 90 degrees, black – Military line**\n\n**– Serrated triglider black 24×60 mm for webbing belt 50 mm – Military Line**\n\n**– SS double ender snap 90 mm, black – Military Line/SS double ender snap 100 mm, black – Military Line/SS double ender snap 115 mm, black – Military Line**\n\n**– SS bolt snap 72 mm, “D” type eye, black – Military Line/SS bolt snap 88 mm, “D” type eye, black – Military Line/SS bolt snap 100 mm, “D” type eye, black – Military Line/SS bolt snap 115 mm, “D” type eye, black – Military Line/SS bolt snap 120 mm, “O” type eye, black – Military Line**\n\n**– SS belt buckle 50 mm with d-ring and logo E, black – Military line**\n\n**– SS belt buckle 50 mmwith logo E, black – Military Line**\n\n**– SS nut and bolt with o-ring long (14 mm), black – Military Line / SS nut and bolt with o-ring short (10 mm), black – Military Line**"
